                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4246732-4bfc-4dbb-899a-ba8422d546bb",
                                "sense_id": "4009db0c-165d-3aa6-a9f8-1e7894038cb9",
                                "text": "Впрочем, очень понятно, что ей стало тебя жалко: ты сделал такую ужасную гримасу, когда ступил на простреленную ногу…",
                                "translation": "It is quite easy, however, to understand that she pitied you; you made such a terrible grimace when you walked on the wounded foot...",
                                "english": "It is quite easy, however, to understand that she pitied you; you made such a terrible grimace when you walked on the wounded foot..."
                            }
                        ]
